WEBVTT

00:45.764 --> 00:47.595
How do you like this building?

00:47.833 --> 00:50.097
ls this a cool place or what?

00:50.302 --> 00:50.996
Yeah...

01:06.752 --> 01:08.652
You're special, you know.

01:09.654 --> 01:15.354
Those ugly dogs in my fan
club don't know about this place.

01:19.998 --> 01:26.836
You disgusting, vulgar,
arrogant, retarded celebrity punk.

01:27.539 --> 01:30.702
Just because you have some TV show.

01:31.109 --> 01:32.371
Give me a break.

01:32.644 --> 01:35.511
Who do you think you are?

01:35.847 --> 01:36.181
Shame--

01:36.181 --> 01:36.806
You bitch!

01:39.985 --> 01:42.647
How do you like being kicked
by a retarded celebrity punk?

01:42.954 --> 01:44.888
You old bitch!

01:46.058 --> 01:49.721
Your stinking perfume makes me sick!

01:50.462 --> 01:53.158
You're the disgusting one, bitch!

02:17.322 --> 02:20.621
l'm going to sue you for this...

02:21.927 --> 02:26.193
M-My son is an excellent lawyer.

02:26.932 --> 02:30.732
A punk like you will
be squashed like a bug.

02:31.403 --> 02:33.462
Do you hear me, punk?

03:37.002 --> 03:41.098
We found traces of two bullets...
in the chest and in the head.

03:41.673 --> 03:43.402
l see signs of blood under the skin.

03:47.245 --> 03:48.610
He must have died instantly.

03:48.914 --> 03:49.778
Mr. Akai...

03:51.082 --> 03:53.812
lt must have been a very special gun...

03:54.586 --> 03:56.781
The bullets exploded inside his body.

04:01.393 --> 04:03.258
Better check those bullet fragments.

04:04.563 --> 04:06.224
ls the medical team here yet?

04:06.498 --> 04:08.796
They're all in the hospital
because of food poisoning.

04:09.000 --> 04:11.093
Those assholes.

04:11.570 --> 04:13.401
What a waste of our tax money.

04:14.039 --> 04:15.006
What's with granny?

04:16.508 --> 04:17.907
Seems shocked to death.

04:18.977 --> 04:21.468
Looks like it was a heart attack.

04:22.547 --> 04:25.141
Get an autopsy just in case.

04:26.184 --> 04:28.744
So, this guy's a celebrity?

04:29.120 --> 04:32.891
He has seven TV shows a week.

04:32.891 --> 04:35.257
He's a popular comedian.

04:36.061 --> 04:37.153
What a joke.

04:37.429 --> 04:40.227
His usual material is about corpses.

04:40.498 --> 04:42.693
Nobody's gonna laugh at this.

04:45.203 --> 04:47.228
What a tearjerker.

04:51.743 --> 04:53.540
H-He was such a nice guy.

04:55.280 --> 04:57.748
W-Why would anyone kill him?

04:59.651 --> 05:04.111
He was the nicest guy l ever knew.

05:06.891 --> 05:10.884
l can't stand breaking up our team like this...

05:11.763 --> 05:13.663
Mr. Ogata at the studio?

05:14.466 --> 05:20.200
His outraged fans are rushing to the location.

05:21.339 --> 05:23.364
We can see how popular he was...

05:25.176 --> 05:33.518
Also, according to sources,
this case may involve organized crime...

05:33.518 --> 05:34.849
Well done.

05:36.521 --> 05:39.456
l feel sorry for that old lady.

05:40.659 --> 05:42.752
People die everyday.

05:45.764 --> 05:46.822
Come here.

05:49.234 --> 05:50.667
l'm not in the mood today.

06:11.790 --> 06:14.350
Be more punctual, Oburi.

06:15.694 --> 06:16.752
Who are we doing?

06:18.963 --> 06:19.861
Which one?

06:22.467 --> 06:23.695
All of them.

06:25.503 --> 06:27.266
We've called someone else in.

06:27.972 --> 06:30.308
You take care of the one in the front.

06:30.308 --> 06:32.276
The other one will take care of the rest.

06:32.577 --> 06:34.511
What did they do?

06:35.213 --> 06:38.114
The three of them are child molesters.

06:38.950 --> 06:42.283
They're going to pay for what they did.

07:01.072 --> 07:03.438
There's another one besides me...

07:25.697 --> 07:28.393
How about this weekend again?

07:28.900 --> 07:31.232
Call me when you can.

07:31.636 --> 07:33.228
You know our usual activity...

07:33.905 --> 07:35.463
My wife just isn't good enough, you know?

08:21.052 --> 08:21.814
Surprised?

08:22.187 --> 08:23.347
You did it?

08:24.189 --> 08:24.780
Right.

09:11.202 --> 09:13.602
The reward for each
adult is the same as always.

09:14.038 --> 09:15.835
Take it from Kanie later.

09:18.743 --> 09:20.768
You stink, Mr. Akai.

09:24.449 --> 09:29.182
Oburi, l don't have an easy job, you know.

09:31.089 --> 09:34.115
The stink from the corpses
makes my eyes water all the time.

09:34.993 --> 09:36.893
And that rotten smell is so strong.

09:38.596 --> 09:41.394
lt's no wonder l always stink.

10:02.921 --> 10:03.819
Mr. Akai...

10:04.489 --> 10:06.980
Did you think about what l asked you?

10:11.763 --> 10:12.354
Sure.

10:12.864 --> 10:15.264
l don't want to hold you back.

10:15.466 --> 10:16.160
Wow...

10:16.834 --> 10:19.667
Your generosity makes me feel weird.

10:22.574 --> 10:23.506
However...

10:23.808 --> 10:26.106
...you have to take care of three more jobs.

10:26.277 --> 10:28.040
l knew you'd say that.

10:28.613 --> 10:31.241
lt's between you and me, isn't it?

10:31.649 --> 10:34.209
We've got to be fair to each other.

10:34.953 --> 10:35.647
Right, Kanie?

10:35.987 --> 10:36.817
lsn't that right?

10:39.557 --> 10:42.754
Mr. Kanie, l'll do my best to be on time.

11:12.523 --> 11:13.891
What are you doing?

11:13.891 --> 11:15.188
You suck!

11:16.060 --> 11:16.719
You're so slow!

11:19.797 --> 11:20.695
You retard!

11:28.973 --> 11:30.201
Give it to me!

11:41.886 --> 11:44.616
Hey, buddy! Give us the ball!

11:48.626 --> 11:50.059
You got my jacket dirty.

11:50.628 --> 11:52.255
lt wasn't that nice, anyway.

11:52.497 --> 11:54.590
Go home and wash it yourself, okay?

12:46.084 --> 12:47.676
He's pretty good.

12:48.252 --> 12:50.618
That's why l need you.

13:02.700 --> 13:04.368
105 yen is your change.

13:04.368 --> 13:06.029
Thank you very much.

13:09.607 --> 13:10.005
Hey!

13:22.920 --> 13:25.047
You look good in that uniform.

13:25.356 --> 13:26.084
You...

13:38.302 --> 13:39.098
Tastes good.

13:39.670 --> 13:40.967
This must be a new flavor.

13:42.440 --> 13:43.031
Want some?

13:43.941 --> 13:46.637
You asked Kanie
where l worked part-time?

13:49.614 --> 13:50.205
So...

13:51.582 --> 13:52.207
What?

13:53.317 --> 13:55.808
Tell me your name.

13:56.687 --> 13:57.346
Sawa.

13:59.423 --> 14:02.859
As in ''the sand you can't hold''
and ''the feather blown by the wind''.

14:03.661 --> 14:04.559
Remember that.

14:05.163 --> 14:06.562
ls that your real name?

14:07.064 --> 14:08.065
Of course.

14:08.065 --> 14:09.133
l'm...

14:09.133 --> 14:09.967
Oburi.

14:09.967 --> 14:11.264
You're Oburi, right?

14:12.637 --> 14:15.197
How much do you know about me?

14:15.940 --> 14:16.929
Are you mad?

14:17.341 --> 14:19.002
No, l'm just...

14:19.911 --> 14:22.641
Kanie told me your name. That's all.

14:23.414 --> 14:25.109
ls Oburi your real name?

14:25.750 --> 14:26.682
Yeah, it is.

14:27.785 --> 14:29.047
lt's a very unusual name.

14:29.754 --> 14:30.914
Everyone says that.

14:34.325 --> 14:35.451
Do you have a family?

14:36.127 --> 14:36.752
Nope.

14:37.562 --> 14:38.426
You?

14:39.964 --> 14:40.988
Me, neither.

14:42.500 --> 14:44.331
We're alike, aren't we?

14:49.540 --> 14:51.337
Can l ask you something?

14:53.911 --> 14:54.912
Sure.

14:54.912 --> 14:55.640
Anything.

14:56.147 --> 14:57.307
l'll tell you.

15:22.673 --> 15:24.937
What is Akai to you?

15:26.244 --> 15:27.472
He's...

15:28.713 --> 15:31.307
...my guardian.

15:33.150 --> 15:34.947
Same as me, huh?

15:35.019 --> 15:36.384
What a strange coincidence...

15:37.889 --> 15:38.753
...we have here.

17:02.873 --> 17:05.239
Those earrings must be special to you.

17:07.211 --> 17:07.939
Why's that?

17:08.379 --> 17:12.372
You were wearing them the last time, too.

17:16.620 --> 17:20.181
They look weird, yet really beautiful.

17:21.659 --> 17:25.322
They're... made from the
blood of my papa and mama.

17:30.835 --> 17:36.273
lt's kind of my lucky charm.

17:41.112 --> 17:41.806
Let's go!

17:43.214 --> 17:43.942
Where is it?

17:44.849 --> 17:47.010
Your place.

18:22.086 --> 18:23.246
Shit...

18:44.475 --> 18:45.976
That's...

18:45.976 --> 18:47.603
You know him?

18:48.079 --> 18:50.013
He's a Hollywood movie star, isn't he?

18:50.881 --> 18:52.815
Some of my classmates are fans.

18:54.218 --> 18:56.345
But l didn't know that he had a twin brother.

18:56.654 --> 18:59.054
They'll be here in a few minutes.

19:01.358 --> 19:03.451
This is the third celebrity.

19:04.595 --> 19:05.493
Kill...

19:06.097 --> 19:07.359
...the right one.

19:07.898 --> 19:10.093
lf l get the wrong one, l'm sorry.

19:12.036 --> 19:16.234
He has three bodyguards, so be careful.

19:20.945 --> 19:22.071
Where do l get him?

25:20.904 --> 25:21.632
Give it back!

25:22.539 --> 25:23.062
Give it back!

25:24.708 --> 25:25.609
Give it back!

25:25.609 --> 25:26.268
Give it back to me!

25:35.853 --> 25:39.880
Don't you want to be
with your papa and mama?

25:42.226 --> 25:43.056
Kill him.

25:47.664 --> 25:53.103
This guy's one of the most
wanted, murdering, perverted bastards.

25:53.103 --> 25:58.375
He's been kidnapping
young girls, raping them...

25:58.375 --> 26:02.613
...and killing them by
chopping their bodies into pieces.

26:02.613 --> 26:05.207
Who cares if one or two guys like him die?

26:35.612 --> 26:39.480
Find whoever killed my papa and mama.

26:39.650 --> 26:43.279
Yeah, l swear l will.

27:04.408 --> 27:06.171
Just die already!

28:46.343 --> 28:50.643
lf we're lucky, we'll find
something left behind by the suspect.

28:50.914 --> 28:52.779
Search every square inch of the room!

28:54.751 --> 28:58.585
You think we can find anything in this mess?

28:59.990 --> 29:02.618
That's what a professional does, right?

29:19.209 --> 29:23.236
lf you fell from this height,
it'd be impossible to identify the body.

29:24.181 --> 29:26.583
Lucky girl.

29:26.583 --> 29:28.744
Must've grown wings or something.

29:30.454 --> 29:33.082
Mr. Akai, can we come in now?

29:33.623 --> 29:35.056
Yeah, go ahead.

29:37.394 --> 29:40.090
There aren't that
many press people here today.

29:40.497 --> 29:43.091
They're all at the police station.

29:43.800 --> 29:46.826
Did they find out about the
chief's Lolita complex or something?

29:47.404 --> 29:49.338
Huh? You didn't know?

29:49.940 --> 29:52.509
There's a witness!

29:52.509 --> 29:53.567
What?

29:59.182 --> 30:00.615
Did he say anything?

30:00.884 --> 30:01.680
No.

30:02.886 --> 30:05.855
He's still in shock, but...

30:06.289 --> 30:07.654
...it's a woman.

30:08.125 --> 30:08.955
A woman?

30:10.193 --> 30:12.218
The killer was a woman.

30:12.696 --> 30:13.890
A young one.

30:29.112 --> 30:30.841
l'm going to go look for it.

30:35.919 --> 30:37.978
You were spotted at the scene, too.

30:38.355 --> 30:41.222
Why didn't you find it for me?

30:41.758 --> 30:44.488
The place was completely destroyed.

30:46.997 --> 30:49.557
That tiny earring must
have been destroyed too.

30:50.000 --> 30:53.570
That earring was important to me.

30:53.570 --> 30:56.130
You should know that best of all.

30:57.941 --> 30:59.966
One should be enough.

31:02.112 --> 31:06.983
Anyway, you should realize the situation.

31:06.983 --> 31:08.746
You killed the client.

31:09.352 --> 31:11.547
Mr. Kanie gave me the wrong target.

31:12.155 --> 31:13.423
lt's not my fault.

31:13.423 --> 31:15.625
The result is all that counts!

31:15.625 --> 31:17.320
Then do it yourself!

31:22.699 --> 31:24.724
Don't stay out for too long!

31:51.528 --> 31:52.426
Sawa!

31:58.935 --> 31:59.458
What's up?

32:05.475 --> 32:07.375
Are you okay?

32:07.777 --> 32:09.176
Of course not.

32:09.713 --> 32:10.771
lt still hurts.

32:11.448 --> 32:13.575
l have a bald spot and everything.

32:13.917 --> 32:14.906
l'm exhausted.

32:15.852 --> 32:16.443
Come in.

32:16.887 --> 32:17.683
l'll make some coffee.

32:18.255 --> 32:19.244
l prefer tea.

32:19.856 --> 32:21.721
Really strong green tea.

32:21.958 --> 32:23.391
l don't have any.

32:25.228 --> 32:26.024
l brought some.

32:34.104 --> 32:35.537
lt's bitter...

32:36.172 --> 32:37.332
lt's good!

32:44.381 --> 32:44.972
Sawa...

32:46.116 --> 32:46.707
What?

32:47.918 --> 32:50.716
What will we be doing ten years from now?

32:51.521 --> 32:52.954
What kind of question is that?

32:57.994 --> 32:59.962
There's only one target.

33:00.630 --> 33:02.655
lt's an easy job for you.

33:04.067 --> 33:05.728
You got that, Oburi?

33:06.736 --> 33:09.364
Be on time tonight.

33:12.676 --> 33:13.233
Sawa...

33:17.080 --> 33:18.240
Ten years...

33:18.682 --> 33:19.580
Five years...

33:20.417 --> 33:23.409
Even tomorrow may never come for us.

33:24.154 --> 33:27.214
All l can do for now is live life to the fullest.

33:28.625 --> 33:30.490
Your life or even tomorrow's lunch...

33:31.061 --> 33:32.460
No one knows what it'll be.

33:33.964 --> 33:34.623
Akai?

33:35.598 --> 33:36.223
That's right.

33:36.933 --> 33:38.400
To kill you.

33:38.902 --> 33:40.836
That's why you came here?

33:41.938 --> 33:42.927
You knew that, right?

33:44.074 --> 33:44.768
Get ready.

33:46.076 --> 33:48.203
Your parents were killed by...

33:48.778 --> 33:49.802
...Akai and Kanie.

33:54.684 --> 33:55.446
l know.

33:55.885 --> 33:56.783
For a long time now.

34:05.762 --> 34:07.957
Promise to come back here.

34:14.037 --> 34:16.801
This guy's a prosecutor for the DA's office.

34:19.042 --> 34:23.411
He was bribed to ignore the
illegal activities of a big corporation.

34:24.514 --> 34:28.974
He'll be in the last train car in
three minutes, so take care of him there.

34:29.919 --> 34:32.046
He doesn't look like a government suit type.

34:32.522 --> 34:33.819
Be careful.

34:35.225 --> 34:37.159
l don't want Mr. Akai to fire me yet.

36:26.369 --> 36:27.836
Who the hell are you?

36:28.037 --> 36:28.969
Don't you know?

36:29.706 --> 36:31.333
Just an ordinary citizen.

36:31.674 --> 36:32.436
Die.

36:43.720 --> 36:45.153
You shitty punk!

36:47.790 --> 36:48.347
You punk!

36:48.625 --> 36:50.058
l'm gonna chop you into pieces!

36:51.794 --> 36:52.624
The one in pieces...

36:53.897 --> 36:54.556
...is you!

38:00.663 --> 38:02.460
Sorry, Mr. Akai.

38:03.499 --> 38:06.957
Oburi, what are you doing?

38:07.537 --> 38:08.469
Don't even try it!

38:10.740 --> 38:12.367
Calm down, okay?

38:12.976 --> 38:15.206
Who the hell was that prosecutor?

38:15.878 --> 38:19.871
A cop from the SWAT team.

38:20.550 --> 38:21.881
Didn't Kanie tell you that?

38:22.385 --> 38:23.875
That guy had a gun...

38:24.621 --> 38:25.747
He tried to kill me!

38:27.957 --> 38:30.551
What do l have to do with that?

38:35.164 --> 38:37.223
l'm going to disappear from your sight.

38:38.735 --> 38:40.669
lf you follow me, l'll kill you.

38:40.970 --> 38:42.301
Hold it. Hold it.

38:42.572 --> 38:44.904
You promised to do
two more jobs, didn't you?

38:46.309 --> 38:47.333
Do it yourself.

38:48.711 --> 38:49.905
ls Sawa with you?

38:50.680 --> 38:51.908
l'm taking her with me.

38:52.882 --> 38:53.814
l see...

39:15.204 --> 39:17.764
You punk! You caused
me quite some trouble...

39:18.541 --> 39:19.439
What happened?

39:20.343 --> 39:21.002
You!

39:21.277 --> 39:22.744
l thought you died already!

39:29.018 --> 39:29.643
Get away!

39:30.553 --> 39:31.520
Get away from him!

39:31.988 --> 39:32.977
Sawa...

39:36.826 --> 39:38.123
Oburi, hang on!

39:38.628 --> 39:39.356
Hang on!

39:42.565 --> 39:43.793
S-Sawa...

39:44.500 --> 39:45.467
Why are you here?

39:46.235 --> 39:46.894
Can you stand?

39:47.537 --> 39:48.799
l guess...

39:51.140 --> 39:53.802
l'm losing feeling in my left arm...

39:54.444 --> 39:56.139
We'd better take care of you quickly.

40:02.418 --> 40:03.077
Don't move!

40:15.164 --> 40:16.096
Sawa...

40:16.632 --> 40:19.226
Oburi, l won't kill you.

40:22.605 --> 40:25.506
Sawa, thank me.

40:37.820 --> 40:41.085
You didn't have to do all this just to kill him.

40:41.391 --> 40:43.860
Just killing him isn't enough for me.

40:43.860 --> 40:45.657
You hate him that much?

40:46.229 --> 40:47.662
lt's not just that.

40:48.064 --> 40:49.998
lt's my hobby.

40:50.366 --> 40:50.991
Hobby?

40:52.235 --> 40:56.171
l really take pleasure in
watching other people's pain.

40:57.507 --> 41:00.965
Nothing else makes me feel like that.

41:01.210 --> 41:02.074
Gross hobby.

41:03.546 --> 41:06.208
Your act really scared me.

41:06.315 --> 41:09.716
l almost thought
you'd betray me for a second...

41:11.220 --> 41:13.450
So, l'll be on my own from now on.

41:13.823 --> 41:15.017
Don't worry.

41:15.091 --> 41:17.355
We already found a replacement for Oburi.

41:18.261 --> 41:19.922
Where are you going to kill him?

41:20.363 --> 41:24.527
The place where we
made you kill for the first time.

41:24.767 --> 41:27.201
l'm looking forward to tomorrow's autopsy.

41:28.137 --> 41:28.796
l'm going back.

41:31.407 --> 41:33.272
Why don't you stay tonight?

41:33.409 --> 41:34.535
l have an exam tomorrow.

41:35.178 --> 41:37.544
Why don't you drop out of college?

41:38.915 --> 41:42.612
l look better with pencils than with guns.

41:45.288 --> 41:48.314
Death caused by massive blood loss.

41:49.659 --> 41:51.217
There are several bullets.

41:51.994 --> 41:54.895
l don't appreciate doing this kind
of stuff first thing in the morning.

41:55.598 --> 41:59.432
We've done most of
the checking before you came in.

41:59.836 --> 42:00.632
Good work.

42:07.410 --> 42:08.536
What's wrong?

42:08.911 --> 42:10.242
This isn't like you...

42:11.314 --> 42:12.508
Did you notice?

42:13.349 --> 42:13.974
What?

42:14.817 --> 42:16.148
l just realized, Mr. Akai...

42:16.986 --> 42:17.577
This place.

42:18.754 --> 42:20.153
lt's a parking lot now...

42:20.923 --> 42:23.983
...but this is where that family
got slaughtered four years ago.

42:25.094 --> 42:25.924
Four years ago...

42:26.629 --> 42:28.688
We did the investigation, you know.

42:29.565 --> 42:32.261
l remember they had a daughter.

42:33.035 --> 42:35.299
She was adopted by somebody.

42:36.138 --> 42:38.436
lt was a really sexy girl.

42:40.009 --> 42:40.941
Oburi...

43:00.463 --> 43:04.797
Oburi, l didn't think
you had the balls to kill Kanie.

43:05.768 --> 43:08.965
But in your condition,
l don't think you can beat me.

43:10.072 --> 43:10.538
Right?

43:14.544 --> 43:16.842
This time, l'll nail you myself!

43:23.352 --> 43:26.753
Right now, you don't even
have the strength to pull the trigger!

43:28.257 --> 43:29.588
Not with your left hand.

43:32.061 --> 43:32.755
Sawa?

43:38.434 --> 43:39.833
What's going on, Sawa?

43:42.838 --> 43:43.702
My hand!

43:44.974 --> 43:46.874
You and Oburi...

43:47.343 --> 43:49.277
The one who killed Kanie was me.

43:49.812 --> 43:50.710
Oburi is fine.

43:51.781 --> 43:54.079
The two of you tricked me...

43:54.584 --> 43:55.073
Why?

43:55.551 --> 43:58.679
Do you know how long
l've waited for this moment?

43:59.255 --> 44:00.347
This is for Papa and Mama...

44:02.625 --> 44:03.523
...and for me.

44:04.393 --> 44:05.860
Sawa!

45:04.320 --> 45:04.979
Let's go!

45:19.135 --> 45:20.295
Where the hell were you?

45:21.303 --> 45:21.826
Shut up!

45:22.238 --> 45:23.262
l'm gonna win today!

45:23.606 --> 45:24.595
Go get everybody!

45:29.512 --> 45:31.139
Wait just a little longer...

45:34.216 --> 45:35.012
Pretty soon...

45:35.584 --> 45:37.074
Oburi will be back.
